## Format

Each item is a level-3 heading under its status section. Order inside a section is priority, most important first. IDs are never reused; take the next one from the line above and increase it in the same edit.

```markdown
### B-<n>: <short title>
- **Type:** <feat | fix | chore | docs> · **Area:** <area> · **Added:** YYYY-MM-DD
<One to three lines: who it's for, what happens today, what should happen.>
<After shaping: the user story, in scope, out of scope, acceptance criteria as a checklist, and how we'll know it worked.>
```

